    "body": "Triage: `P6`, `enhancement`, `area:2d`, `effort:high`.\n\nWhy: open edge chains are a new capability for 2D Chamfer, not a defect - today it does what the issue says it does not do. The work spans the geometry, motion and stock-simulation paths, so the safety floor sets `effort:high`. `source:agent` is not set: a human account opened this issue. It is the partial case left out of #2887; #2930 covers the note after it.\n",
